        "answer": {
          "short": "$AD=12\\sqrt3\\text{ cm}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\cos30^\\circ&=\\frac{AD}{24}\\\\AD&=24\\cos30^\\circ\\\\AD&=24\\times\\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}\\\\AD&=12\\sqrt3\\text{ cm}.\\end{align*}$$",
