        "answer": {
          "short": "$DC=4\\sqrt3\\text{ cm}$",
          "worked": "In $\\triangle ABC$, $\\angle BCA=60^\\circ$.\n$$\\begin{align*}BC&=24\\tan30^\\circ\\\\BC&=8\\sqrt3\\text{ cm}.\\end{align*}$$\nIn $\\triangle BDC$,\n$$\\begin{align*}DC&=BC\\cos60^\\circ\\\\DC&=8\\sqrt3\\times\\frac12\\\\DC&=4\\sqrt3\\text{ cm}.\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
